{"seq":1,"slug":"draft-model-speculation","title":"独立草稿模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/draft-models/draft-model-speculation","wordCount":1263,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"独立草稿模型\">独立草稿模型</h1><p>把一个 1B 的小模型拴在 70B 的大模型旁边专门负责「猜」，是推测解码最早、也最直观的形态——Leviathan 与 Chen 在 2023 年的原始论文用的就是这个设置。它的魅力在于通用：不需要改目标模型一行代码，只要找一个「够像、够快」的小模型就能用。它的全部难点，也都集中在「够像」与「够快」这对矛盾，以及一个常被忽视的硬约束——词表必须对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-用一个便宜模型逼近昂贵模型的分布\">核心概念：用一个便宜模型逼近昂贵模型的分布</h2><p>独立草稿模型方案里有两个角色：目标模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（要加速的大模型）和草稿模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（独立的小模型）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 自回归地连猜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一次并行验证。理想的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 要同时满足三个条件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[理想独立草稿模型] --&gt; B[&quot;够像: 与目标分布接近&lt;br/&gt;-&gt; 接受率 α 高&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;够快: 单步前向远快于目标&lt;br/&gt;-&gt; 草稿开销小&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;词表对齐: 与目标共享 tokenizer&lt;br/&gt;-&gt; 接受准则可逐 token 比较&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;α 高则单轮产出多&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;草稿成本占比低&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;否则无法对齐 logits 做拒绝采样&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[理想独立草稿模型] --&gt; B[\"够像: 与目标分布接近&lt;br/&gt;-&gt; 接受率 α 高\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"够快: 单步前向远快于目标&lt;br/&gt;-&gt; 草稿开销小\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"词表对齐: 与目标共享 tokenizer&lt;br/&gt;-&gt; 接受准则可逐 token 比较\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"α 高则单轮产出多\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"草稿成本占比低\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"否则无法对齐 logits 做拒绝采样\"]</pre><p>这三者互相拉扯：模型越大越像但越慢，越小越快但越不像。最优草稿模型大小通常落在目标模型参数量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{30}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间——既能跑出可观接受率，单步成本又低到几乎可以忽略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"词表对齐-最容易踩的硬约束\">词表对齐：最容易踩的硬约束</h2><p>无损推测的接受准则要逐 token 比较草稿分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 与目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（见 <a href=\"../foundations/lossless-guarantee\">分布无损性保证</a>）。这要求两个模型<strong>说同一种「token 语言」</strong>：相同的 tokenizer、相同的词表、相同的 token id 映射。否则草稿给出的「token 17」在目标模型里可能是完全不同的字，接受准则无从比较。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>满足时</th>\n<th>不满足时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同词表</td>\n<td>可直接逐 token 比较 logits</td>\n<td>接受准则失效，无法做标准拒绝采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同系列</td>\n<td>分布天然接近，α 高</td>\n<td>需额外蒸馏 / 微调拉近分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异词表（跨家族）</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>需 token 级翻译或专门的跨词表推测方法（仍是研究前沿）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中最省心的做法是用同一模型家族的小尺寸版本：例如 Llama 3.x 70B 配 Llama 3.x 1B/8B、Qwen3 系列的大小搭配。它们共享 tokenizer，分布天然接近，开箱即用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练一个专用草稿模型-fastdraft-与蒸馏路线\">训练一个专用草稿模型：FastDraft 与蒸馏路线</h2><p>现成的小模型不一定够像。2024 年以来一批工作（如 FastDraft）专门研究「怎么为给定目标模型训出最佳草稿」，核心手段是<strong>蒸馏</strong>——让草稿模型直接学目标模型的输出分布，而不只是学原始语料：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>distill</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{distill}} = \\mathbb{E}_{x}\\,\\big[\\, \\mathrm{KL}\\big(p_{M_p}(\\cdot \\mid x)\\;\\|\\;q_{M_q}(\\cdot \\mid x)\\big)\\,\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">distill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0973em;vertical-align:-0.3473em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>蒸馏让草稿在「目标模型实际会去的地方」对齐得更好，从而显著抬高接受率。这与 <a href=\"../../model-compression-inference/pruning-and-distillation/knowledge-distillation\">模型压缩与推理 · 知识蒸馏</a> 是同一套技术，只是目的不同：那里蒸馏是为了得到一个能独立服役的小模型，这里蒸馏是为了得到一个专门给大模型当「跟班」的草稿。2026 年 6 月 DeepSeek 开源的 DeepSpec codebase 就提供了在 Qwen3、Gemma 等开放模型上训练与评测草稿模型的工具链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价-显存-调度与-赔本-风险\">代价：显存、调度与「赔本」风险</h2><p>独立草稿模型不是免费的，它带来三笔实打实的开销：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>显存</strong>：草稿模型要常驻显存，对显存紧张的部署是真实成本。1B 草稿在 70B 旁边占比不大，但在中小模型上占比可观。</li>\n<li><strong>调度复杂度</strong>：服务框架要同时编排两个模型的前向、管理两套 KV cache，在连续批处理下尤其棘手（见 <a href=\"../practice/serving-batching-spec\">批服务下的推测</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>赔本风险</strong>：如果草稿和目标分布偏差大、接受率掉到某个阈值以下，草稿的额外开销会超过它省下的时间，整体反而变慢。经验阈值是接受率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≳</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\gtrsim 0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span> 时才稳赚；低于此要小心。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[独立草稿模型总账] --&gt; B[&quot;收益: 单轮多吐 token&lt;br/&gt;正比于接受长度&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;成本: 草稿 γ 步前向&lt;br/&gt;+ 额外显存 + 调度&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D{收益 &gt; 成本?}&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|α 高| E[&quot;净加速 1.3-3x&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|α 低| F[&quot;可能净减速 -&gt; 应关闭推测&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[独立草稿模型总账] --&gt; B[\"收益: 单轮多吐 token&lt;br/&gt;正比于接受长度\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"成本: 草稿 γ 步前向&lt;br/&gt;+ 额外显存 + 调度\"]\n  B --&gt; D{收益 &gt; 成本?}\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|α 高| E[\"净加速 1.3-3x\"]\n  D --&gt;|α 低| F[\"可能净减速 -&gt; 应关闭推测\"]</pre><p>正因为这些代价，业界后来发展出两条「不再需要独立模型」的路线——让目标模型自己当草稿（<a href=\"self-speculative\">自推测与早退</a>），或干脆不用模型（<a href=\"ngram-retrieval-draft\">n-gram 与检索草稿</a>）。但独立草稿模型至今仍是通用性最强、接受率上限最高的方案，尤其在能负担显存、且有现成同系列小模型时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>独立草稿模型是推测解码的原始形态：用一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{30}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大小的同系列小模型专门猜 token，目标模型并行验证。</li>\n<li>三个理想条件：够像（高接受率）、够快（低草稿成本）、词表对齐（接受准则可逐 token 比较）；其中词表对齐是硬约束，跨家族需专门方法。</li>\n<li>现成小模型不够像时，可用蒸馏（最小化目标与草稿分布的 KL）专门训练草稿，DeepSpec 等工具链已开源。</li>\n<li>代价是额外显存、调度复杂度与「赔本」风险；经验上接受率需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≳</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gtrsim 0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span> 才稳赚，否则应关闭推测。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：免去独立模型的两条路线见 <a href=\"self-speculative\">自推测与早退</a> 与 <a href=\"ngram-retrieval-draft\">n-gram 与检索草稿</a>；接受率与成本的定量关系见 <a href=\"../practice/acceptance-rate-tuning\">接受率与加速比</a>。跨库可参考 <a href=\"../../model-compression-inference/pruning-and-distillation/knowledge-distillation\">模型压缩与推理 · 知识蒸馏</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"独立草稿模型","id":"独立草稿模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：用一个便宜模型逼近昂贵模型的分布","id":"核心概念-用一个便宜模型逼近昂贵模型的分布"},{"level":2,"text":"词表对齐：最容易踩的硬约束","id":"词表对齐-最容易踩的硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"训练一个专用草稿模型：FastDraft 与蒸馏路线","id":"训练一个专用草稿模型-fastdraft-与蒸馏路线"},{"level":2,"text":"代价：显存、调度与「赔本」风险","id":"代价-显存-调度与-赔本-风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布无损性保证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/foundations/lossless-guarantee"},"next":{"title":"自推测与早退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/speculative-decoding/draft-models/self-speculative"}}